B.aBH=s(["Digits on the drums no longer show the edges of their neighbours.","Who disputes a REPort votes for it at once.","A voice bar runs to the end.","Reasons and comments have no line breaks: Enter closes the keyboard or sends.","An encrypted group without its key says how to get it back.","In the web version there are no scrollbars, the mouse wheel glides, and Esc closes a window or goes back."],t.s)
